{
  "version": "0",
  "suite": "ed25519-jcs-v0",
  "note": "Reproducible bound-tier verification vectors. The keypair is TEST-ONLY (private key in the clear). Ed25519 is deterministic, so re-signing the same claim with the same key reproduces signature.value byte-for-byte.",
